> * * After advanced backup is enabled, this parameter no longer takes effect. Use the AdvancedDataPolicies parameter instead.', example='Monday,Tuesday', position='Query'),
  preferredBackupTime?: string(name='PreferredBackupTime', description='The time period during which automatic backup is performed. Specify the time period in the `hh:mmZ-hh:mmZ` format in UTC. The values must be on the hour with an interval of 1 hour, such as `14:00Z-15:00Z`.', example='15:00Z-16:00Z', position='Query'),
