> - If you specify this parameter, you must set `UpgradePolicy` to **COLD**.', example='INNOVATE', position='Query'),
  upgradePolicy?: string(name='UpgradePolicy', description='The upgrade policy for the kernel version. Valid values:

- **HOT**: hot upgrade

- **COLD**: cold upgrade. This upgrade method is supported only for PolarDB for MySQL 8.0 clusters.', example='HOT', position='Query'),
  upgradeType?: string(name='UpgradeType', description='The upgrade type. Valid values:

- **PROXY**: Upgrades only the database proxy (PolarProxy).

